$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=bvmchkqrec  LOC_AFTER=?

* The q-recursion of the restricted check sum (Lean mCheckQ_rec, at q = P Q with ( P gcd Q ) = 1): m_Q ( X ) = m_PQ ( X ) - P ^c -u S m_PQ ( X / P ). The multiples of P are reindexed by dvdsflf1o.

